OL,3,ABaby born during Harry Potter screening
OL,4,Ahas 'Cineworld' on birth certificate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman gave birth in a cinema after
OL,7,Fgoing into labour in the middle of a
OL,8,Fmovie, with the newborn's birth
OL,9,Fcertificate officially recording the
OL,10,Funusual place of birth.
OL,12,FMolly Connah, 32, had been overdue by a
OL,13,Fday when she took her nine-year-old son
OL,14,FAlfie to see Harry Potter and the
OL,15,FPhilosopher's Stone.
OL,17,FBaby Elsie Lamb was born in the
OL,18,FCineworld at Broughton, Flintshire,
OL,19,Fwith staff assisting and paramedics
OL,20,Farriving moments later.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
